(6240715, 922389, 112828, '<td valign="top">I love the authenticity here, and the steam is really the final touch.<br/> <br/>Your processing is a little bland, but the photo stands well enough on it''s own.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the authenticity here, and the steam is really the final touch. Your processing is a little bland, but the photo stands well enough on it''s own.  Well done.', '2010-12-01 16:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240717, 923202, 112828, '<td valign="top">What the hell is that?  It''s either a phone booth on a bridge of some sort, or, well, a phone booth ride on a bridge of some sort....<br/> <br/>Frankly this is a puzzling image, and I like it very much!<br/> <br/>Lighting was pretty harsh here, but you get what you get sometimes!</td>', 'What the hell is that?  It''s either a phone booth on a bridge of some sort, or, well, a phone booth ride on a bridge of some sort.... Frankly this is a puzzling image, and I like it very much! Lighting was pretty harsh here, but you get what you get sometimes!', '2010-12-01 16:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240723, 922999, 112828, '<td valign="top">If he''s not a model, he''s surely wondering what the heck you''re up to! :)<br/> <br/>I think the tilt is a cleaver way to deal with a difficult to photograph subject, that both adds motion and removes distractions.<br/> <br/>I really do wish there was some real white in this image, as it''s just a bit gray as it is..</td>', 'If he''s not a model, he''s surely wondering what the heck you''re up to! :) I think the tilt is a cleaver way to deal with a difficult to photograph subject, that both adds motion and removes distractions. I really do wish there was some real white in this image, as it''s just a bit gray as it is..', '2010-12-01 16:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240727, 922274, 81312, '<td valign="top">Looks really funny...</td>', 'Looks really funny...', '2010-12-01 16:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240735, 923043, 110041, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the border.</td>', 'Not keen on the border.', '2010-12-01 16:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240755, 923172, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nah, everything looks like it turns the normal direction on this phone.. :)<br/> <br/>Really though, a good photo that just does a nice job of showing a modern payphone..</td>', 'Nah, everything looks like it turns the normal direction on this phone.. :) Really though, a good photo that just does a nice job of showing a modern payphone..', '2010-12-01 17:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240761, 922947, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wwwwow!  Excellent colors, what a grand scene!..<br/> <br/>So, I really do like the image, I think you''ve found a gem of a location, but I think you would have done well to step back and zoom in some, as there''s significant distortion in the photo, and you should have been just a bit lower, as the camera is tilted downwards - warping everything in the photograph - or alternatively, some correction in PP would have been fine..</td>', 'Wwwwow!  Excellent colors, what a grand scene!.. So, I really do like the image, I think you''ve found a gem of a location, but I think you would have done well to step back and zoom in some, as there''s significant distortion in the photo, and you should have been just a bit lower, as the camera is tilted downwards - warping everything in the photograph - or alternatively, some correction in PP would have been fine..', '2010-12-01 17:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240764, 923133, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm, grainy goodness!  I almost feel this this must have been taken with a camera phone, as there''s tons of noise and chromatic aberration..  <br/> <br/>Still, a cool capture of a very unusual scene, thanks!!</td>', 'Hmm, grainy goodness!  I almost feel this this must have been taken with a camera phone, as there''s tons of noise and chromatic aberration..   Still, a cool capture of a very unusual scene, thanks!!', '2010-12-01 17:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240766, 923138, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective!  There are several really wonderful shots of phone parts that I''ve really enjoyed, I like your shallow DOF and the dusty weathered nature of the shot!</td>', 'Excellent perspective!  There are several really wonderful shots of phone parts that I''ve really enjoyed, I like your shallow DOF and the dusty weathered nature of the shot!', '2010-12-01 17:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240768, 922274, 112828, '<td valign="top">Cleaver!  I love the implication here, very creative..<br/> <br/>Technically you''ve got horrible lighting conditions here, although that did lead to a great shadow, but blew out the whites while leaving the shadows in darkness...   Sooo, hmm.. Love the photo, technicals are weak, but who cares, it''s still an awesome shot!</td>', 'Cleaver!  I love the implication here, very creative.. Technically you''ve got horrible lighting conditions here, although that did lead to a great shadow, but blew out the whites while leaving the shadows in darkness...   Sooo, hmm.. Love the photo, technicals are weak, but who cares, it''s still an awesome shot!', '2010-12-01 17:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240769, 922438, 112828, '<td valign="top">Poor old thing!!  What''s funny is that it looks like a very modern design..</td>', 'Poor old thing!!  What''s funny is that it looks like a very modern design..', '2010-12-01 17:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240773, 922275, 112828, '<td valign="top">What an odd piece of art.  I love that the phone is, as it almost always is, missing....  Poor kid looks pretty dumb standing there for eternity holding an imaginary telephone..</td>', 'What an odd piece of art.  I love that the phone is, as it almost always is, missing....  Poor kid looks pretty dumb standing there for eternity holding an imaginary telephone..', '2010-12-01 17:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240774, 922235, 112828, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  The shot seems a bit over sharpened, but still a really great juxtapositioning here!!</td>', 'Great capture!  The shot seems a bit over sharpened, but still a really great juxtapositioning here!!', '2010-12-01 17:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240777, 923111, 112828, '<td valign="top">What a great shot, love the feeling here, kinda dark and moody, but shiny and bright at the same time.. <br/> <br/>Great way to deal with difficult shooting conditions, the chrome and black are nearly impossible to capture well in basic, but your treatment of just blowing out the whites and keeping deep blacks really worked for this image..</td>', 'What a great shot, love the feeling here, kinda dark and moody, but shiny and bright at the same time..  Great way to deal with difficult shooting conditions, the chrome and black are nearly impossible to capture well in basic, but your treatment of just blowing out the whites and keeping deep blacks really worked for this image..', '2010-12-01 17:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240779, 923101, 112828, '<td valign="top">I assume this was a night shot?  Pretty nice, but there is a ton of distortion (barrel) and a pretty big tilt too...   Some PP corrections would have helped here..</td>', 'I assume this was a night shot?  Pretty nice, but there is a ton of distortion (barrel) and a pretty big tilt too...   Some PP corrections would have helped here..', '2010-12-01 17:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240783, 922440, 112828, '<td valign="top">I love this!  So, fess up, did you donate to her bucket if she''d model this for you??  Pretty darn good idea really..<br/> <br/>If this is natural, then +5 awesomeness points for you, you still get the same score (8)</td>', 'I love this!  So, fess up, did you donate to her bucket if she''d model this for you??  Pretty darn good idea really.. If this is natural, then +5 awesomeness points for you, you still get the same score (8)', '2010-12-01 17:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240796, 923052, 110041, '<td valign="top">Composition is not quite there i.e. uneven distances left an right and the cropping out the bottoms of the booths. I like the B&amp;W conversion and the vignette, but it does need centralising.</td>', 'Composition is not quite there i.e. uneven distances left an right and the cropping out the bottoms of the booths. I like the B&W conversion and the vignette, but it does need centralising.', '2010-12-01 17:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240801, 922947, 110041, '<td valign="top">Who put that big boring wall in the middle of the shot? Love the colours but the interesting bits are awkwardly placed.</td>', 'Who put that big boring wall in the middle of the shot? Love the colours but the interesting bits are awkwardly placed.', '2010-12-01 17:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240827, 922473, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat job on the processing.</td>', 'Neat job on the processing.', '2010-12-01 17:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
