(6240887, 922364, 96751, '<td valign="top">Terrific pov.  Love the lines and textures of the twisted coil.</td>', 'Terrific pov.  Love the lines and textures of the twisted coil.', '2010-12-01 18:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240890, 923210, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this abstract.  The red reflection really adds some emotional content; the texture of the metallic surfaces is also great.</td>', 'I love this abstract.  The red reflection really adds some emotional content; the texture of the metallic surfaces is also great.', '2010-12-01 18:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240892, 922956, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  This looks a lot like Union Station, and if it''s US, then this looks a lot like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">melethia</a> creation.  Great street capture.  The tilt adds an element of voyeurism.</td>', 'Hmmmm.  This looks a lot like Union Station, and if it''s US, then this looks a lot like a  melethia creation.  Great street capture.  The tilt adds an element of voyeurism.', '2010-12-01 18:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240894, 923173, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ominous!!</td>', 'Ominous!!', '2010-12-01 18:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240895, 923111, 96751, '<td valign="top">So many great details in this image - the angle, the reflection in the bottom square, the position of the cable.  And the pp''ing -  it looks like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jutilda</a> with a Droid and lomo app :-)</td>', 'So many great details in this image - the angle, the reflection in the bottom square, the position of the cable.  And the pp''ing -  it looks like a  jutilda with a Droid and lomo app :-)', '2010-12-01 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241038, 922323, 100831, '<td valign="top">bird</td>', 'bird', '2010-12-01 20:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241532, 922769, 6565, '<td valign="top">Really great take on the challenge. The increasing blur in the distance makes the phones literally fade away, and the row of them looks so dignified. Hope this one takes the win!</td>', 'Really great take on the challenge. The increasing blur in the distance makes the phones literally fade away, and the row of them looks so dignified. Hope this one takes the win!', '2010-12-02 02:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241534, 923126, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great composition and setting, really creates a mood! The color definitely works in your favor, even though this one would be tempting to do in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Great composition and setting, really creates a mood! The color definitely works in your favor, even though this one would be tempting to do in B&W.', '2010-12-02 02:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241687, 922704, 123833, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2010-12-02 06:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241688, 921936, 123833, '<td valign="top">Nice - taken while lying on the pavement?</td>', 'Nice - taken while lying on the pavement?', '2010-12-02 06:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241752, 923119, 30861, '<td valign="top">Socorro, New Mexico? I''ve stopped in there, years and years ago :-) I love how matter-of-fact this image is.</td>', 'Socorro, New Mexico? I''ve stopped in there, years and years ago :-) I love how matter-of-fact this image is.', '2010-12-02 08:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241800, 922625, 3102, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to sound overly critical, but it seems like you almost treated this challenge as a scavenger hunt, rather than a photo competition.  Finding one is part of the challenge, of course, but nailing it photographically is the key.  The phone booth isn''t even in focus... the background is.  Once you find a subject for a challenge entry, try viewing from different angles to make it visually interesting, and then be sure to nail the technical aspects of it.</td>', 'I don''t want to sound overly critical, but it seems like you almost treated this challenge as a scavenger hunt, rather than a photo competition.  Finding one is part of the challenge, of course, but nailing it photographically is the key.  The phone booth isn''t even in focus... the background is.  Once you find a subject for a challenge entry, try viewing from different angles to make it visually interesting, and then be sure to nail the technical aspects of it.', '2010-12-02 09:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241884, 922992, 112828, '<td valign="top">I love the rich colors here and the mysterious darkness...</td>', 'I love the rich colors here and the mysterious darkness...', '2010-12-02 10:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241888, 922402, 112828, '<td valign="top">Great nighttime shot here.. Judging by the SuperSpar signs, this must be in Africa somewhere?  Probably South Africa???<br/> <br/>Love the light trails and the star bursts, very nice job!</td>', 'Great nighttime shot here.. Judging by the SuperSpar signs, this must be in Africa somewhere?  Probably South Africa??? Love the light trails and the star bursts, very nice job!', '2010-12-02 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241892, 921936, 112828, '<td valign="top">Great pun...  You did a nice job of processing here, and while a shallower DOF would have been nice, this really is effective at grabbing my interest!</td>', 'Great pun...  You did a nice job of processing here, and while a shallower DOF would have been nice, this really is effective at grabbing my interest!', '2010-12-02 10:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241897, 923064, 112828, '<td valign="top">Looks lovely there... Actually, those are simply the most charming phones anywhere in the world, really a shame so few are left..<br/> <br/>The technicals here are weak, but for bad lighting you did pretty good..</td>', 'Looks lovely there... Actually, those are simply the most charming phones anywhere in the world, really a shame so few are left.. The technicals here are weak, but for bad lighting you did pretty good..', '2010-12-02 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241900, 923203, 112828, '<td valign="top">Indeed it is...  Kinda makes you wonder about the person who installed it...<br/> <br/> <br/>I really like the entire phone here, just a nice, simple example of a regular phone..</td>', 'Indeed it is...  Kinda makes you wonder about the person who installed it...  I really like the entire phone here, just a nice, simple example of a regular phone..', '2010-12-02 11:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241903, 923146, 112828, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure about the focus here, I can see that you were drawing our attention to the keypad, but I almost find the phone receiver distracting here...  But the reflection of the receiver in the grime on the chrome is great!</td>', 'I''m not so sure about the focus here, I can see that you were drawing our attention to the keypad, but I almost find the phone receiver distracting here...  But the reflection of the receiver in the grime on the chrome is great!', '2010-12-02 11:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241905, 922991, 112828, '<td valign="top">Indeed, so many of them are.... :)<br/> <br/>Seriously, I must have checked out 20 different payphones for this challenge, and I think two might have been in working order...<br/> <br/>Some perspective correction would have helped this image quite a bit.</td>', 'Indeed, so many of them are.... :) Seriously, I must have checked out 20 different payphones for this challenge, and I think two might have been in working order... Some perspective correction would have helped this image quite a bit.', '2010-12-02 11:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241906, 923157, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent mood shot, I''m almost scared for her safety.  Of course, this is how we used to go about making a call when out and about, but it just seems so ill advised. :)</td>', 'Excellent mood shot, I''m almost scared for her safety.  Of course, this is how we used to go about making a call when out and about, but it just seems so ill advised. :)', '2010-12-02 11:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241908, 922660, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nice phones!  I like how different each is from the other, and the generally wonderful location.  You have done an excellent job with this, and you''ve clearly found a great set of phones!</td>', 'Nice phones!  I like how different each is from the other, and the generally wonderful location.  You have done an excellent job with this, and you''ve clearly found a great set of phones!', '2010-12-02 11:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241911, 923119, 112828, '<td valign="top">A local huh? :)  This place is about 10 minutes from my house, and they do make one of the best (and fastest) burgers you''ll ever eat.<br/> <br/>I assume you must have been enjoying the Bosque Del Apache?  It also looks like this was taken on a Sunday, as they''re normally packed all day long :)<br/> <br/>So, as for the picture?  Not bad!  I like the sepia treatment, but I''m almost sad that it wasn''t a night shot with the blinking yellow light over the intersection, as that''s been a shot I''ve wanted to take for a while now...</td>', 'A local huh? :)  This place is about 10 minutes from my house, and they do make one of the best (and fastest) burgers you''ll ever eat. I assume you must have been enjoying the Bosque Del Apache?  It also looks like this was taken on a Sunday, as they''re normally packed all day long :) So, as for the picture?  Not bad!  I like the sepia treatment, but I''m almost sad that it wasn''t a night shot with the blinking yellow light over the intersection, as that''s been a shot I''ve wanted to take for a while now...', '2010-12-02 11:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241913, 923016, 112828, '<td valign="top">Interesting box!  I''d love to score this super high, because the mood here is pretty darn cool, but I''ve got to admit, that noise is going to have to cost a couple of points, still, thanks for sharing, it''s a very interesting tele!</td>', 'Interesting box!  I''d love to score this super high, because the mood here is pretty darn cool, but I''ve got to admit, that noise is going to have to cost a couple of points, still, thanks for sharing, it''s a very interesting tele!', '2010-12-02 11:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241914, 922686, 112828, '<td valign="top">No she did not..  And it turned out that the babies were more evil than Ma... :)<br/> <br/>So, wow!  What a great weathered box, love the fact that it''s mostly unbroken and largely intact, while still being horribly weathered and beaten.<br/> <br/>Not sure about your crop here, but I''m going to assume you had good reason.</td>', 'No she did not..  And it turned out that the babies were more evil than Ma... :) So, wow!  What a great weathered box, love the fact that it''s mostly unbroken and largely intact, while still being horribly weathered and beaten. Not sure about your crop here, but I''m going to assume you had good reason.', '2010-12-02 11:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6241916, 923126, 112828, '<td valign="top">What an odd location, hopefully there''s more about this place in your notes!<br/>I love the whole phone as a phonebook thing, it''s pretty reminiscent of what I saw when these things were common (and I still used them...)</td>', 'What an odd location, hopefully there''s more about this place in your notes!I love the whole phone as a phonebook thing, it''s pretty reminiscent of what I saw when these things were common (and I still used them...)', '2010-12-02 11:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
