(6244410, 923004, 112828, '<td valign="top">Snowy with a good helping of grain, very nice..  Looks like some sort of very modern phone, what gets me is the inclusion of two keypads, what the heck is up with that?!</td>', 'Snowy with a good helping of grain, very nice..  Looks like some sort of very modern phone, what gets me is the inclusion of two keypads, what the heck is up with that?!', '2010-12-04 12:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244411, 922357, 112828, '<td valign="top">That''s a rare one, not only did you manage to find what may be the last functional red booth, but you''ve also managed to find someone using it?  What did you setup a tent in the park next door??<br/> <br/>Seriously!?  And how the heck are there flowers growing here?  I though England should be frozen solid about this time of year???<br/> <br/>Seriously though, a really lovely capture - I might have liked a more aggressive post treatment, but I''m not going to worry about that.</td>', 'That''s a rare one, not only did you manage to find what may be the last functional red booth, but you''ve also managed to find someone using it?  What did you setup a tent in the park next door?? Seriously!?  And how the heck are there flowers growing here?  I though England should be frozen solid about this time of year??? Seriously though, a really lovely capture - I might have liked a more aggressive post treatment, but I''m not going to worry about that.', '2010-12-04 12:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244413, 922483, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wow..  What a poor phone!!  Looks like someone was a little mad at it for, perhaps?, not working?<br/> <br/>I love the tight crop here, and that super low sun - you must have taken this right at sunset!</td>', 'Wow..  What a poor phone!!  Looks like someone was a little mad at it for, perhaps?, not working? I love the tight crop here, and that super low sun - you must have taken this right at sunset!', '2010-12-04 12:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244415, 923002, 112828, '<td valign="top">What a very odd phone. I assume you used flash here?  Really not a bad effort, but the composition is sloppy and the flash blew out some highlights..  Still, a fun image, thanks for sharing with us!</td>', 'What a very odd phone. I assume you used flash here?  Really not a bad effort, but the composition is sloppy and the flash blew out some highlights..  Still, a fun image, thanks for sharing with us!', '2010-12-04 12:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244417, 923199, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Excellent image!<br/> <br/>I love the starbursts here and the fact that someone is actually using a phone!?!  The streak of light from the vehicle on the street shows me that you did this as a long exposure, and therefore the person had to stay very still, so I''m guessing this was a model?  <br/> <br/>Wonderful image, one of the best!</td>', 'Wow!  Excellent image! I love the starbursts here and the fact that someone is actually using a phone!?!  The streak of light from the vehicle on the street shows me that you did this as a long exposure, and therefore the person had to stay very still, so I''m guessing this was a model?   Wonderful image, one of the best!', '2010-12-04 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
