(6244422, 922769, 3554, '<td valign="top">Good choice of depth of field and desaturation. I like how the subject is isolated.</td>', 'Good choice of depth of field and desaturation. I like how the subject is isolated.', '2010-12-04 12:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244424, 922402, 3554, '<td valign="top">The first thing that draws me in are the colors. The blurred traffic going by suggests the future moving on while the old standby phone stands patiently - ready if someone has a breakdown.</td>', 'The first thing that draws me in are the colors. The blurred traffic going by suggests the future moving on while the old standby phone stands patiently - ready if someone has a breakdown.', '2010-12-04 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244425, 923075, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. The title and composition work well together. I fear it won''t be pretty enough for many DPC voters but appreciate that it tells a story and isn''t simply eye candy.</td>', 'I really like this one. The title and composition work well together. I fear it won''t be pretty enough for many DPC voters but appreciate that it tells a story and isn''t simply eye candy.', '2010-12-04 13:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244426, 922364, 112828, '<td valign="top">Perhaps my favorite image in the challenge...  I love the heavy hitting styling here, and the very unique perspective - kinda reminds me of looking at payphones as a child.<br/> <br/>Great eye, and a wonderful capture!</td>', 'Perhaps my favorite image in the challenge...  I love the heavy hitting styling here, and the very unique perspective - kinda reminds me of looking at payphones as a child. Great eye, and a wonderful capture!', '2010-12-04 13:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244427, 922540, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like the first car in the background - it adds a spooky late night "they''re coming to get you" feeling to it. B&amp;W and your DoF work for this one.</td>', 'I really like the first car in the background - it adds a spooky late night "they''re coming to get you" feeling to it. B&W and your DoF work for this one.', '2010-12-04 13:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244429, 922364, 3554, '<td valign="top">Great creative angle, I really like the texture of the cord and the snake like quality it suggests.</td>', 'Great creative angle, I really like the texture of the cord and the snake like quality it suggests.', '2010-12-04 13:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244431, 922540, 112828, '<td valign="top">Poor old thing!<br/> <br/>The abandoned phone on the wayside is a killer concept, I really like the feeling of isolation and loneliness.  The dusty display is a bonus for this image, and my eye is drawn to it very quickly.</td>', 'Poor old thing! The abandoned phone on the wayside is a killer concept, I really like the feeling of isolation and loneliness.  The dusty display is a bonus for this image, and my eye is drawn to it very quickly.', '2010-12-04 13:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244432, 923172, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and use of B&amp;W</td>', 'I like the perspective and use of B&W', '2010-12-04 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244433, 922798, 3554, '<td valign="top">This is one of the more unusual takes (unusual in a good way) and I like it quite well. The flatness of it works for me.</td>', 'This is one of the more unusual takes (unusual in a good way) and I like it quite well. The flatness of it works for me.', '2010-12-04 13:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244434, 923047, 112828, '<td valign="top">Really?  Wow!!  I''d bet this is a setup shot, as it''s just wayyyy too good otherwise, hell it''s still too good, I''m giving you a 10 here..<br/> <br/>You''ve really managed to capture something awesome here, as it tells a strong, emotive story that will resonate well I suspect.</td>', 'Really?  Wow!!  I''d bet this is a setup shot, as it''s just wayyyy too good otherwise, hell it''s still too good, I''m giving you a 10 here.. You''ve really managed to capture something awesome here, as it tells a strong, emotive story that will resonate well I suspect.', '2010-12-04 13:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244435, 922798, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love that glossy smoothness along with the grainy BG, very, very cool - the title is just lagniappe!</td>', 'Oh, I love that glossy smoothness along with the grainy BG, very, very cool - the title is just lagniappe!', '2010-12-04 13:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244437, 923191, 3554, '<td valign="top">This "hone" has seen a lot of use/abuse and has character so I think you picked a good subject. I like the bike in the reflection. If there was a way to avoid the ".ry leaning" text in the window I think that would be a bonus.</td>', 'This "hone" has seen a lot of use/abuse and has character so I think you picked a good subject. I like the bike in the reflection. If there was a way to avoid the ".ry leaning" text in the window I think that would be a bonus.', '2010-12-04 13:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244438, 922704, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, although the lighting is a bit harsh here, I like the middle of the night feeling here, it kinda makes you wonder who or what she''s worried about!</td>', 'Excellent shot, although the lighting is a bit harsh here, I like the middle of the night feeling here, it kinda makes you wonder who or what she''s worried about!', '2010-12-04 13:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244439, 923043, 112828, '<td valign="top">How funny, they''ve managed to mangle everything but the coin box, definitely says something about the quality of that part of the construction :)</td>', 'How funny, they''ve managed to mangle everything but the coin box, definitely says something about the quality of that part of the construction :)', '2010-12-04 13:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244440, 923052, 3554, '<td valign="top">I wonder if cropping the brick out would have made this image more striking. Something about the brick doesn''t work for me. I like the symmetry a lot though.</td>', 'I wonder if cropping the brick out would have made this image more striking. Something about the brick doesn''t work for me. I like the symmetry a lot though.', '2010-12-04 13:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244442, 922794, 112828, '<td valign="top">A very interesting USWest (now Qwest isn''t it?) box..  I''m going to have to look at your notes on this, as I''m curious where this one is located...  <br/> <br/>Love those blues and oranges!</td>', 'A very interesting USWest (now Qwest isn''t it?) box..  I''m going to have to look at your notes on this, as I''m curious where this one is located...   Love those blues and oranges!', '2010-12-04 13:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244443, 923010, 112828, '<td valign="top">How, very, very, very ... odd.<br/> <br/>This looks too realistic to not be real.. :)  Seriously though, it doesn''t have power or lines, so I''m assuming this is an art installation?  What a cool and unique phone!  Well done..</td>', 'How, very, very, very ... odd. This looks too realistic to not be real.. :)  Seriously though, it doesn''t have power or lines, so I''m assuming this is an art installation?  What a cool and unique phone!  Well done..', '2010-12-04 13:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244444, 923158, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the processing and grittiness. I think the lights at the top are an element that gives this one some oomph to move it out of the ordinary into something interesting.</td>', 'I like the processing and grittiness. I think the lights at the top are an element that gives this one some oomph to move it out of the ordinary into something interesting.', '2010-12-04 13:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244445, 923195, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and ethereal feel</td>', 'I like the composition and ethereal feel', '2010-12-04 13:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244446, 923060, 112828, '<td valign="top">A touch heavy on the processing, but what a grand view indeed, hell locations like this could make pay phones popular again.. :)<br/> <br/>"Oh, no worries honey, I''m just going to the part to use the phone...." :)</td>', 'A touch heavy on the processing, but what a grand view indeed, hell locations like this could make pay phones popular again.. :) "Oh, no worries honey, I''m just going to the part to use the phone...." :)', '2010-12-04 13:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244449, 922235, 3554, '<td valign="top">All the elements in this shot come together to make a pretty interesting photo imo. The phone, man, his clothes, and the green sign in the background all come together for me. I like that he''s got his back to us.</td>', 'All the elements in this shot come together to make a pretty interesting photo imo. The phone, man, his clothes, and the green sign in the background all come together for me. I like that he''s got his back to us.', '2010-12-04 13:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244450, 923173, 112828, '<td valign="top">LOL, I guess that''s to keep people from breaking the thing... :)<br/> <br/>Seriously, you''ve done a great job at creating a wonderfully moody photograph, I especially like the unusual point of focus and the very odd sticker.. :)</td>', 'LOL, I guess that''s to keep people from breaking the thing... :) Seriously, you''ve done a great job at creating a wonderfully moody photograph, I especially like the unusual point of focus and the very odd sticker.. :)', '2010-12-04 13:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244451, 923031, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at that phonebook!!<br/> <br/>It''s pretty amusing that the phone is missing but the book is still there, kinda makes you wonder if someone stole the phone...</td>', 'Wow, look at that phonebook!! It''s pretty amusing that the phone is missing but the book is still there, kinda makes you wonder if someone stole the phone...', '2010-12-04 13:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244452, 923101, 3554, '<td valign="top">I almost like this shot - I think it''s better than average but there''s something holding it back. I''m not sure if it needs be straightened a little or if its the color of the top third or the fact that the phone itself seems a little oof or overexposed in places (to the left of the top of the receiver). Or maybe all of those things.</td>', 'I almost like this shot - I think it''s better than average but there''s something holding it back. I''m not sure if it needs be straightened a little or if its the color of the top third or the fact that the phone itself seems a little oof or overexposed in places (to the left of the top of the receiver). Or maybe all of those things.', '2010-12-04 13:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244453, 922621, 112828, '<td valign="top">Scratches of use!  Actually, this is rather odd, as it''s still a $0.25 phone, when most have moved to .50c or more...<br/> <br/>It''s funny how that part of a phone really does draw our attention strongly, I wonder if that''s because it''s the "money" part of the phone, or if it''s just the great design of the whole thing... :)</td>', 'Scratches of use!  Actually, this is rather odd, as it''s still a $0.25 phone, when most have moved to .50c or more... It''s funny how that part of a phone really does draw our attention strongly, I wonder if that''s because it''s the "money" part of the phone, or if it''s just the great design of the whole thing... :)', '2010-12-04 13:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244454, 923207, 3554, '<td valign="top">I work on a reservation and this really told a story to me. I think a tighter crop might have benefitted it. I think I''d try cropping some of the right off and tease us more with the sunset.</td>', 'I work on a reservation and this really told a story to me. I think a tighter crop might have benefitted it. I think I''d try cropping some of the right off and tease us more with the sunset.', '2010-12-04 13:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244456, 922851, 112828, '<td valign="top">867-5309, Jenny don''t loose that number......<br/> <br/>LOL, seriously, this is a pretty cool phone, and maybe I''ll put in a request at PLA''s phone show to give a call this Tuesday evening..</td>', '867-5309, Jenny don''t loose that number...... LOL, seriously, this is a pretty cool phone, and maybe I''ll put in a request at PLA''s phone show to give a call this Tuesday evening..', '2010-12-04 13:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244457, 923195, 112828, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool image here, I like how the low contrast and glow caused by the glass affects the image...  Very cool and well done!</td>', 'Pretty cool image here, I like how the low contrast and glow caused by the glass affects the image...  Very cool and well done!', '2010-12-04 13:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244458, 922625, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm, it''s blurry!  Not to nitpick, but it would seem that you''ve managed to focus on the shrubbery behind the phone...  Oh well, thanks for sharing your cool phone booths!</td>', 'Hmm, it''s blurry!  Not to nitpick, but it would seem that you''ve managed to focus on the shrubbery behind the phone...  Oh well, thanks for sharing your cool phone booths!', '2010-12-04 13:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244459, 923075, 112828, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT, I love this, as it does a good job of showing the portion of society who still does rely on these things, I hope they all found work that day.</td>', 'EXCELLENT, I love this, as it does a good job of showing the portion of society who still does rely on these things, I hope they all found work that day.', '2010-12-04 13:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244462, 922956, 112828, '<td valign="top">LOL!!   You seem to have dropped something sir.. :)<br/> <br/>So, what, were you just sitting at the bus station and happened upon this?  Well, well, well done. :)</td>', 'LOL!!   You seem to have dropped something sir.. :) So, what, were you just sitting at the bus station and happened upon this?  Well, well, well done. :)', '2010-12-04 13:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244463, 923191, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh, how wonderfully grimy!!!  I love everything about this..  It really speaks to the disuse and abuse these poor things are subject to..</td>', 'Oh, how wonderfully grimy!!!  I love everything about this..  It really speaks to the disuse and abuse these poor things are subject to..', '2010-12-04 13:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244465, 923157, 3554, '<td valign="top">All the parts of this one come together to tell a story to me. When I look at this I see a woman in trouble. Maybe her car broke down in a bad part of town or perhaps she''s running from an abusive relationship. The contrast of dark and light as well as the apparent movement of her hair and the back alley feel of the environment tell a story.</td>', 'All the parts of this one come together to tell a story to me. When I look at this I see a woman in trouble. Maybe her car broke down in a bad part of town or perhaps she''s running from an abusive relationship. The contrast of dark and light as well as the apparent movement of her hair and the back alley feel of the environment tell a story.', '2010-12-04 13:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244468, 923004, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like your use of perspective.</td>', 'I like your use of perspective.', '2010-12-04 13:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244469, 923064, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the red booth against the snow but the background feels over processed to me.</td>', 'I like the red booth against the snow but the background feels over processed to me.', '2010-12-04 13:24:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6244655, 923034, 80061, '<td valign="top">This is a very good picture for me. Only if the lighting was coming in another direction. This is a 10+ for me, well done!</td>', 'This is a very good picture for me. Only if the lighting was coming in another direction. This is a 10+ for me, well done!', '2010-12-04 19:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244780, 922274, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice thinking here. Would love to have seen better light and maybe isolating the scene with less depth.</td>', 'Nice thinking here. Would love to have seen better light and maybe isolating the scene with less depth.', '2010-12-04 23:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6244799, 922402, 86218, '<td valign="top">Difficult scene to expose and make all the elememnts work together for this challenge. <br/>Likes. Love the colours working together yet contrasting in many ways. Reds and Blues in the sky. Sky especially as clean as it is helps in this scene. The lights of the cars are quiet a thick stream of lights and maybe just a tad to much, yet it needs to be there as it forms a nice leading line to our phone also being red as the lights itself. The big light with it''s flare I like. Flares also brining eyes back to the phone. Repetitive pattern of the paving used to good effect.<br/> <br/>Dislikes. Glare in the scene against the fence and the phone itself. Also the to strong white lights in the cars competing a bit to much with the street light which needs to be the main light - for me at least.<br/>Giving it a 7 as there has def gone a lot of thinking into it which is more than for most of the pics with just a simple straight forward shot of a payphone. <br/>Summary<br/>Elements at this spot has been used to good effect to work together in making it pleasent, yet other things over which you have little control <br/>also works against it.</td>', 'Difficult scene to expose and make all the elememnts work together for this challenge. Likes. Love the colours working together yet contrasting in many ways. Reds and Blues in the sky. Sky especially as clean as it is helps in this scene. The lights of the cars are quiet a thick stream of lights and maybe just a tad to much, yet it needs to be there as it forms a nice leading line to our phone also being red as the lights itself. The big light with it''s flare I like. Flares also brining eyes back to the phone. Repetitive pattern of the paving used to good effect. Dislikes. Glare in the scene against the fence and the phone itself. Also the to strong white lights in the cars competing a bit to much with the street light which needs to be the main light - for me at least.Giving it a 7 as there has def gone a lot of thinking into it which is more than for most of the pics with just a simple straight forward shot of a payphone. SummaryElements at this spot has been used to good effect to work together in making it pleasent, yet other things over which you have little control also works against it.', '2010-12-05 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
