(6248678, 922275, 124457, '<td valign="top">Interesting bronze statue but trying to find something I like about the picture. No pop, looks flat. Light cast on kids head, flash or sun? Distracting background store window makes me want to window shop and forget it was a phone challenge especially since the phone unit is out of focus or appears to be because of light reflection shining off it. Didn''t even notice the phone in the kids hand at first. Looks like the other is having trouble hitting the coin slot. Was this taken in shadows or at night?</td>', 'Interesting bronze statue but trying to find something I like about the picture. No pop, looks flat. Light cast on kids head, flash or sun? Distracting background store window makes me want to window shop and forget it was a phone challenge especially since the phone unit is out of focus or appears to be because of light reflection shining off it. Didn''t even notice the phone in the kids hand at first. Looks like the other is having trouble hitting the coin slot. Was this taken in shadows or at night?', '2010-12-08 08:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
